# Zolto Phase 9 — Component, Template & Macro System

This document showcases the Phase 9 reusable abstraction layer.

---

## 1. Custom Component Definition & Use

component Badge(label!, count=0, pill=true, tone="neutral")
badge tone=tone pill=pill
{label} {count}
end
end

Badge(label="Notifications", count=12, tone="warning")

---

## 2. Named Slots & Fallbacks

component Panel(title="")
slot header
### {title}
end

slot default
No content provided.
end

slot footer
---
*Footer Area*
end
end

Panel(title="User Directory")

fill header
# Registered Users
end

- Alice (Admin)
- Bob (Developer)
- Charlie (Designer)

fill footer
Last updated today
end

end

---

## 3. Templates & Template Inheritance

template BaseReport(title, date)
# {title}
*Date: {date}*

slot body
Default report content.
end
end

template SalesReport extends BaseReport
fill body
## Quarterly Sales Breakdown
1. Q1 — $120,000
2. Q2 — $180,000
3. Q3 — $240,000
4. Q4 — $310,000
end
end

SalesReport(title="FY2026 Executive Summary", date="2026-07-26")

---

## 4. Macros (Text, Parameterized, Block)

macro note(text)
info
{text}
end

macro copyright()
© 2026 Zolto Project. All rights reserved.
end

note("Macros expand before rendering and support safe recursion controls.")

copyright()

---

## 5. Conditionals & Loops

component UserList(users=[])
each users as user, index
- #{index}: **{user.name}** ({user.role})
end
end

UserList(users=[{name="Alice", role="Admin"}, {name="Bob", role="Developer"}])
